@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# OpenCode Android v1.0.2 — Release Notes
+
+Patch release focused on AMOLED visual consistency and UI polish.
+
+---
+
+## AMOLED UI Consistency
+
+- Chat message bubbles and tool/result cards now use true black surfaces with accent borders
+- Chat menus, model picker, and compose input area are aligned to the same AMOLED style
+- Session list dialogs and rows now render with consistent true black styling and borders
+- Home screen server card actions and FAB now avoid tonal tinting and keep true black backgrounds
+
+## Dialog and Menu Polish
+
+- Reworked rename/delete dialogs in session list to match AMOLED border style
+- Reworked add/edit server dialog to use the same AMOLED-aware dialog surface treatment
+- Added AMOLED borders to overflow menus for better visual separation
+
+## Home Screen Style Alignment
+
+- Connected and disconnected server cards now use matching background style in non-AMOLED dark mode
+- Improved visual consistency between pre-connection and post-connection states
